window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Evil awakens. A hero rises. The quest to save humanity begins.</b><br> <br> Becca Moore has always felt like the outcast, a misfit adrift in a world that doesn’t quite understand her. But when she learns she’s one of the Chosen, fated to mend the fraying barrier between our reality and a realm teeming with demonic forces, her life is thrust into chaos. As malevolent powers stir, monstrous creatures shatter the tranquility of her once ordinary existence, forcing Becca to confront a fate she never imagined.<br> <br> In the mountains of western Maryland, the Strickland family struggles to overcome their own brushes with death as shadows loom over the World of Light. Retired Army veteran Pete Strickland is a resilient truck driver, battling the harsh realities of his new life when the encroaching darkness threatens his family. His daughter, Janie, embodies fierce determination despite the odds, igniting hope when all seems lost. Meanwhile, Pete’s son, Chris, must push the limits of bravery, risking everything to defend those he loves.<br> <br> United by fate, Becca and the Stricklands join forces to resist the approaching tide of evil. With danger lurking around every turn, Becca must harness her newfound abilities and summon the courage to face her deepest fears. Will they stand together against the rising threat, or will evil shatter their bonds and consume everything they hold dear?<br> <br> <b>If you love the 1990s, you'll love Dial-Up Doom!</b></p>"; 
